# Allow-list: the build context carries only what the Dockerfile copies and
# builds. Everything else (the repository's history, agent and fleet files,
# documents, local state, secrets) is not sent to the builder.
*

!go.mod
!go.sum
!cmd
!internal
!testdata/fixture/discount

# Inside an allowed directory, still never send these.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.DS_Store
